    <fr:title text="Multiplication Table">Multiplication Table</fr:title>
    <fr:taxon>Definition</fr:taxon>
  </fr:frontmatter>
  <fr:mainmatter>
    <html:p>
Let <fr:tex display="inline">G= \{g_1, g_2, \cdots , g_n\}</fr:tex> is finite group. The multiplication table is the <fr:tex display="inline">n\times  n</fr:tex> matrix whose <fr:tex display="inline">i,j</fr:tex> entry is the group element <fr:tex display="inline">g_i \circ  g_j</fr:tex></html:p>
  </fr:mainmatter>
